<h3>Casio SA-35 Decent Sampler instrument</h3>

<p>
  a
  <a rel="external" href="https://www.decentsamples.com/product/decent-sampler-plugin/">Decent Sampler</a>
  instrument of all (except one) of the base tones on the Casio SA-35 keyboard (also released by Radioshack as the
  Realistic Concertmate-470). i picked this keyboard up at a thrift store a couple of years ago and fell in love with
  it! it’s got a super charming and nostalgic sound. all the patches were recorded
  <abbr title="Direct Input">DI</abbr> using the provided headphone jack, the only processing done being some minor
  noise reduction to tame some noise/static.
</p>

