<h3>SMI-1460 electronic drum kit voices</h3>

<p>
  voices from my SMI-1460 electronic drum kit that was handed down to me. included are two variations:
  <abbr>DI</abbr> through the two 1/4" jacks on the back, and through a normal IEC cassette tape with an Optimus CTR-117
  cassette recorder. no processing was done other than a little EQ and normalisation.
</p>

